[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21729.51, "timestamp": "06:02:09", "text": "造成更大的破壞，或許就能得到那枚好鏡頭。我希望我能做出最大的貢獻。  我想做出最大的貢獻。我相信我可以把它藏起來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21736.628, "timestamp": "06:02:16", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21741.99, "timestamp": "06:02:21", "text": "為什麼它要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21743.11, "timestamp": "06:02:23", "text": "那裡？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21745.51, "timestamp": "06:02:25", "text": "哦，那個人也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21747.27, "timestamp": "06:02:27", "text": "開啟了自動模式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21751.47, "timestamp": "06:02:31", "text": "。我看見你。  我看見你。走，走，走，走，走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21759.67, "timestamp": "06:02:39", "text": "閃避。誰在用水"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21766.948, "timestamp": "06:02:46", "text": "？我不知道，夥計"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21769.27, "timestamp": "06:02:49", "text": "。我因為用槍指著Jigga而被槍擊了。你不是Jigga。"}]